      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `publish_event.py` that publishes a JSON event to a managed messaging topic or queue, I will use AWS SNS (Simple Notification Service) as the concrete external provider. This choice is based on the requirement to use a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in the code. AWS SNS is a fully managed messaging service that can be used to send messages to multiple subscribers. </thinking>\n\n",
